WHAT CHANGED (audit class before: NOT-FOUND)
--------------------------------------------
workspace_rules was always String::new(); the target repo's AGENTS.md /
CLAUDE.md / .cursor/rules/*.mdc / .modbit/rules.md were never read.

scheduler::read_workspace_rules now collects, in order: root AGENTS.md,
root CLAUDE.md, .modbit/rules.md, sorted .cursor/rules/*.mdc, then
subdirectory AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md (walk depth <= 4; .git, hidden dirs,
node_modules, target skipped; root-first so deeper files appear later).
Each file: 64 KiB cap with a visible truncation marker and a per-file
sha256 provenance header. The combined segment feeds AgentTask.
workspace_rules and rides the prompt compiler's workspace-rules segment
as repo DATA — never system authority (docs/52).

